WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.000
-I feel the love!
Welcome, everybody!

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.167
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "the Tonight Show."

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:06.400
You're here. You made it.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you for being here.

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:12.734
Well, guys,
yesterday was Election Day,

00:00:12.734 --> 00:00:14.767
and despite some recent polls

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:17.501
that show former President Trump
leading President Biden,

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:20.567
Democrats had
a surprisingly strong night.

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:22.834
Republicans were like,
"How is that possible?"

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:25.200
Democrats were like,
"No, seriously,
how is that possible?"

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:28.033
Yep, Democrats
had a strong night

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:29.968
in Republican-leaning states

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:32.067
like Kentucky, Ohio,
and Virginia.

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:34.701
It's odd. It's like hearing
BTS swept every category

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:37.801
at tonight's
Country Music Awards.

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:39.734
Yep, yesterday,
Americans went to the polls,

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:42.033
and today we're learning a lot
about the new ballot measures

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.434
each state approved.

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:44.868
They're pretty interesting.

00:00:44.868 --> 00:00:47.234
For instance, Ohio voted
to legalize marijuana.

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:50.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.033
Meanwhile, Indiana voted to

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:54.667
enjoy the contact high
from Ohio.

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:56.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.534 --> 00:00:59.167
Up next,
New Jersey voted to reclassify

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:01.868
sweatsuits and pinky rings
as "business casual."

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:04.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:05.868
-Hey!

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:08.033
-Also, Massachusetts voted to

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:11.634
provide universal Dunkin'
to kids in Pre-K.

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:13.567
Important.

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:15.467
Up next, Montana voted to

00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:19.167
reluctantly host your dad on
his "Yellowstone" fanboy trip.

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:20.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:22.000
"Oh, you're a cowboy."

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.100
Up next, Kentucky voted to

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:28.634
change their state motto
to "I'm Just Ken...tucky."

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:30.234
Kind of good.
-Wow.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:33.033
-West Virginia voted to
charge every tourist $100

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:35.400
if they sing
"Take Me Home, Country Roads."

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:40.434
Here's another one.
Delaware voted to make Joe Biden

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:43.701
2023's Sexiest Man Alive.

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:47.200
Wow. You can make that happen.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.467
And finally, Colorado voted
to legalize marijuana again

00:01:50.467 --> 00:01:52.834
because they forgot
they already did.

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:56.267
A lot happened.
Very big day. Important.

00:01:56.267 --> 00:01:59.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:01.100
Some more election news --
the white House said

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.367
that polls showing
Biden trailing Trump

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.767
in a hypothetical 2024 matchup

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:08.901
should be taken
with a grain of salt.

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:13.000
Although, at Biden's age, maybe
a grain of salt substitute.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Mrs. Dash, Mr. Biden.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.601
Some more political news --
earlier tonight,

00:02:17.601 --> 00:02:20.434
NBC aired the third Republican
presidential debate.

00:02:20.434 --> 00:02:21.634
It was quite a night.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:23.234
There were five candidates
on stage,

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:25.067
three moderators
asking questions,

00:02:25.067 --> 00:02:27.334
and two people watching at home.

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:28.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.767 --> 00:02:30.167
Whatever you think about Trump,

00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:31.901
Republican debates are kind of
meaningless without him.

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:34.701
It's like a football game
without Taylor Swift.

00:02:34.701 --> 00:02:36.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:37.501
But the five candidates
who were there

00:02:37.501 --> 00:02:39.801
did everything they could
to get people's attention.

00:02:39.801 --> 00:02:41.734
We actually have a photo
from the debate.

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:43.234
I thought that was weird.
It's just...

00:02:43.234 --> 00:02:45.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:47.000
Well, get this --
a new poll shows that

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.868
in his home state of Florida,
Ron DeSantis is trailing Trump.

00:02:50.868 --> 00:02:52.767
-Ooh.
-Yeah.

00:02:52.767 --> 00:02:54.200
I don't think
DeSantis has the right people

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.200
running his campaign.
I mean, take a look at this ad

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.367
I saw today.

00:02:57.367 --> 00:02:59.634
-Some people want me,
Ron DeSantis,

00:02:59.634 --> 00:03:01.400
to drop out of the race.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:05.234
But we don't need less Ron.
We need...More Ron.

00:03:05.234 --> 00:03:07.367
We need More Ron
to help the country.

00:03:07.434 --> 00:03:09.634
We need More Ron
to bring people together,

00:03:09.634 --> 00:03:11.968
because even my haters
see me on the street

00:03:11.968 --> 00:03:13.501
and yell, "Hey, More Ron!"

00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:18.367
-You see what I'm saying?
It's just confusing to me.

00:03:18.367 --> 00:03:21.133
That's confusing.
-Wow! That's not a good ad.

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:23.501
-I don't know. I don't think so.

00:03:23.501 --> 00:03:25.133
-That is not a good effort.

00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:27.334
-Yeah. I don't know. I think
he needs better people.

00:03:27.334 --> 00:03:28.801
Some more big news out today.

00:03:28.801 --> 00:03:30.534
Ivanka Trump testified

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:32.634
in her dad's New York
civil fraud trial.

00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:35.133
Yeah, which is exciting
because now I can complete

00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:37.667
my set of Trump
courtroom-sketch trading cards.

00:03:37.667 --> 00:03:39.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:41.434
Well, switching gears, guys,
tomorrow night is

00:03:41.434 --> 00:03:44.133
the "Women Tell All" episode
of "The Golden Bachelor."

00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:45.934
-Ooh.
-[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:45.934 --> 00:03:48.634
-Yeah, before Gary decides
between his final three,

00:03:48.634 --> 00:03:51.667
we're gonna hear from all
the women he dated this season.

00:03:51.667 --> 00:03:53.968
And it looks pretty juicy.
Watch this.

00:03:53.968 --> 00:03:56.400
It's "The Golden Bachelor:
Women Tell All."

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.567
Gary sent them home,
but now they're back.

00:03:58.567 --> 00:04:03.567
We'll hear from Ellen, Susan,
Nancy, Kathy, Blanche,

00:04:03.567 --> 00:04:06.133
Rose, Dorothy, Sophia,

00:04:06.133 --> 00:04:07.534
Grace and Frankie...

00:04:07.534 --> 00:04:09.434
and next year's
Golden Bachelorette...

00:04:09.434 --> 00:04:11.667
Madea.
-Hellur!

00:04:11.667 --> 00:04:13.501
-Yeah. Interesting.
I can't wait.

00:04:13.501 --> 00:04:16.234
That's gonna be good.
"Hellur."

00:04:16.234 --> 00:04:19.100
[ Applause ]

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.434
Well, some business news.

00:04:20.434 --> 00:04:22.601
I saw that Pizza Hut
in Hong Kong

00:04:22.601 --> 00:04:25.100
is selling a pizza
topped with snake meat.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:26.534
[ Audience groans ]

00:04:26.534 --> 00:04:28.968
Everyone in Hong Kong
was like, "Ew. Pizza Hut?"

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:31.767
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.767 --> 00:04:33.334
Snake on pizza.

00:04:33.334 --> 00:04:35.968
And somehow it's still less
controversial than pineapple.

00:04:35.968 --> 00:04:37.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:37.601 --> 00:04:39.200
You like pineapple?

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:40.634 --> 00:04:42.067
-No.
-Absolutely not.

00:04:42.067 --> 00:04:43.934
No, no. Absolutely not.
You can't do it.

00:04:43.934 --> 00:04:46.667
[ Applause ]
Thank you.

00:04:46.667 --> 00:04:49.567
Finally, I heard
that a menu from the "Titanic"

00:04:49.567 --> 00:04:54.200
is expected to sell in auction
for up to $86,000.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.067
$86,000.
That's how desperate people are

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:58.868
for a menu that's not a QR code.

00:04:58.868 --> 00:05:00.801
We have a great show tonight.

